# Directories renv should not scan for package dependencies.
#
# renv uses implicit snapshots, which means it reads every file in the
# project looking for library() calls. Without this file that includes the
# 317 MB of CDISC reference material under refs/, and dependency discovery
# takes over ten minutes.
#
# Every real dependency lives in R/, sessions/ or exercises/.

refs/
docs/
_freeze/
data/
renv/library/
renv/staging/
